### Cancelar una ejecución de plan de trabajo — 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/cancelExecution
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1
}

### Sin token → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/cancelExecution
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 1
}

### Sin workPlanExecutionId (requerido) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/cancelExecution
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
}

### Ejecución inexistente → 400/500 según manejo del SP
POST {{baseUrl}}/UnitWorkplan/cancelExecution
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "workPlanExecutionId": 999999999
}
